{"createdAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z", "updatedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z", "id": "barongWtraffic001", "name": "barong控制台-W系列-独立站流量采集", "description": null, "active": true, "isArchived": false, "nodes": [{"parameters": {"content": "## barong控制台-W系列-独立站流量采集（barongWtraffic001）\n\n**这个工作流是干嘛的**：每 10 分钟（`5-55/10 * * * *`，太平洋时间）从独立站的 Jetpack\n统计接口拉七样东西——按天访问 30 天、按小时访问 24 小时、热门页面、来源、国家、\n搜索词、外链点击——原样打包推给控制台 `/w/traffic/ingest`。贸易公司主页置顶那张\n「独立站流量」卡就吃这份数据。\n\n**为什么 10 分钟一轮**：用户要的是「当天流量，5-10 分钟延迟」。一轮七个 GET 一个\nPOST，一天 144 轮，Jetpack 接口免费无配额。\n\n**红线**：\n- **不加工数据**。这里只打包，归一化 / 时区 / 聚合全在控制台\n  `backend/app/modules/w_series/traffic/service.py`。Jetpack 形状变了改那一处。\n- **不给「写入控制台」加重试**。控制台失败下一轮自然重来；连续失败次数在\n  `worker_heartbeats.w-traffic` 里，那才是该看的地方。\n- **七个 GET 任一失败不拖死整批**：失败分支置 null，控制台只更新拿到的列。\n- **令牌独立**：请求头 `X-Ingest-Token` 与控制台 env `W_TRAFFIC_INGEST_TOKEN` 同值，\n  和 W 订单同步那把不同。密钥没配时端点一律 401（fail-closed）。\n\n**验收只认一样东西**：`worker_heartbeats` 里 `w-traffic.last_success_at` 每 10 分钟\n刷新。主页流量卡超过 20 分钟没心跳会变红「采集停了」。\n`python scripts/check_worker_heartbeats.py --json` 不依赖控制台 UI。\n\n**时区**：Jetpack 按站点时区分日（实测 UTC-5），控制台原样入库；控制台在洛杉矶\n显示时会标「站点时区」。\n\n端点：backend/app/modules/w_series/router.py::traffic_ingest\n", "height": 760, "width": 620, "color": 4}, "id": "9c4e1b2a-7d3f-5a6e-b1c0-2f8d4e6a7b90", "name": "说明便签", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-700, 60]}, {"parameters": {"rule": {"interval": [{"field": "cronExpression", "expression": "5-55/10 * * * *"}]}}, "id": "1a2b3c4d-5e6f-5071-8293-a4b5c6d7e8f9", "name": "每10分钟", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [0, 420]}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/visits?unit=day&quantity=30", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e0-0000-5000-8000-000000000001", "name": "按天访问30d", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 60], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/visits?unit=hour&quantity=24", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e1-0000-5000-8000-000000000011", "name": "按小时访问24h", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 180], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/top-posts?period=day&num=30&max=10", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e2-0000-5000-8000-000000000021", "name": "热门页面30d", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 300], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/referrers?period=day&num=30&max=10", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e3-0000-5000-8000-000000000031", "name": "来源30d", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 420], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/country-views?period=day&num=30", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e4-0000-5000-8000-000000000041", "name": "国家30d", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 540], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/search-terms?period=day&num=30", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e5-0000-5000-8000-000000000051", "name": "搜索词30d", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 660], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"url": "https://barongyekhna.com/wp-json/jetpack/v4/stats-app/sites/242834372/stats/clicks?period=day&num=30", "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType", "nodeCredentialType": "wordpressApi", "options": {"timeout": 30000}}, "id": "b7a3c9e6-0000-5000-8000-000000000061", "name": "外链点击30d", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [220, 780], "credentials": {"wordpressApi": {"id": "kaIcXMDT4cNA0GXm", "name": "Wordpress account"}}, "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"numberInputs": 7, "mode": "combine", "combineBy": "combineByPosition", "options": {}}, "id": "c0ffee00-1234-5678-9abc-def012345678", "name": "汇合7路", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge", "typeVersion": 3, "position": [480, 420]}, {"parameters": {"jsCode": "// 沙箱里没有 fetch / require / URL —— 所有数据只能来自上游节点。\n// 七路分支各自失败时（HTTP 节点 onError=continueRegularOutput），它的 json 长这样\n// { error: {...} }；置 null，让控制台只更新真正拿到的列。\nconst NAMES = [\"按天访问30d\", \"按小时访问24h\", \"热门页面30d\", \"来源30d\", \"国家30d\", \"搜索词30d\", \"外链点击30d\"];\nconst FIELDS = [\"visits_day\", \"visits_hour\", \"top_posts\", \"referrers\", \"country_views\", \"search_terms\", \"clicks\"];\nfunction pick(name) {\n  try {\n    const j = $(name).first().json;\n    if (!j || typeof j !== 'object' || j.error) return null;\n    return j;\n  } catch (e) {\n    return null;\n  }\n}\nconst parts = {};\nfor (let i = 0; i < NAMES.length; i += 1) parts[FIELDS[i]] = pick(NAMES[i]);\nlet utc_offset = null;\nfor (const v of Object.values(parts)) {\n  if (v && typeof v.utc_offset === 'string') { utc_offset = v.utc_offset; break; }\n}\nconst branches_ok = Object.values(parts).filter(Boolean).length;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  site_id: 242834372,\n  collected_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  utc_offset,\n  branches_ok,\n  ...parts,\n} }];"}, "id": "d1e2f3a4-b5c6-5d7e-8f90-a1b2c3d4e5f6", "name": "打包", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [700, 420]}, {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "http://console_backend:8000/w/traffic/ingest", "sendHeaders": true, "headerParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "X-Ingest-Token", "value": "__W_TRAFFIC_INGEST_TOKEN__"}]}, "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}", "options": {"timeout": 60000}}, "id": "e2f3a4b5-c6d7-5e8f-90a1-b2c3d4e5f6a7", "name": "写入控制台", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [920, 420], "alwaysOutputData": true, "onError": "continueRegularOutput"}, {"parameters": {"jsCode": "// 任何分支都要能走到这里 —— 失败也要留下一行可读的执行快照。\nconst r = $input.first().json || {};\nlet note;\nif (typeof r.days_upserted === 'number') {\n  note = `已入库 ${r.days_upserted} 天 / ${r.hours_upserted} 小时`\n       + (r.day_from ? `（${r.day_from} → ${r.day_to}）` : '')\n       + (Array.isArray(r.warnings) && r.warnings.length ? `；告警：${r.warnings.join('；')}` : '');\n} else {\n  note = '写入控制台失败 —— 看 console_backend 日志和 worker_heartbeats.w-traffic';\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ...r, note } }];"}, "id": "f3a4b5c6-d7e8-5f90-a1b2-c3d4e5f6a7b8", "name": "记录结果", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [1140, 420]}], "connections": {"每10分钟": {"main": [[{"node": "按天访问30d", "type": "main", "index": 0}, {"node": "按小时访问24h", "type": "main", "index": 0}, {"node": "热门页面30d", "type": "main", "index": 0}, {"node": "来源30d", "type": "main", "index": 0}, {"node": "国家30d", "type": "main", "index": 0}, {"node": "搜索词30d", "type": "main", "index": 0}, {"node": "外链点击30d", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "汇合7路": {"main": [[{"node": "打包", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "打包": {"main": [[{"node": "写入控制台", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "写入控制台": {"main": [[{"node": "记录结果", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "按天访问30d": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]}, "按小时访问24h": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 1}]]}, "热门页面30d": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 2}]]}, "来源30d": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 3}]]}, "国家30d": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 4}]]}, "搜索词30d": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 5}]]}, "外链点击30d": {"main": [[{"node": "汇合7路", "type": "main", "index": 6}]]}}, "settings": {"timezone": "America/Los_Angeles", "executionOrder": "v1"}, "staticData": null, "meta": null, "pinData": null, "versionId": "6f2d7c1e-9a44-5b3a-8c0e-1d5e7a9b2c41", "activeVersionId": "6f2d7c1e-9a44-5b3a-8c0e-1d5e7a9b2c41", "versionCounter": 1, "triggerCount": 1, "tags": [], "shared": [{"updatedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z", "createdAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z", "role": "workflow:owner", "workflowId": "barongWtraffic001", "projectId": "SjZCov4RK9CKr2EU", "project": {"updatedAt": "2026-03-24T07:46:51.801Z", "createdAt": "2026-03-24T06:44:50.688Z", "id": "SjZCov4RK9CKr2EU", "name": "Guangrui Sun <barongyekhna@barongyekhna.com>", "type": "personal", "icon": null, "description": null, "creatorId": "4282a344-7d2e-5380-a49b-a7383ab463b1"}}], "versionMetadata": {"name": null, "description": null}}